    {
      "id": "claim_4fed1bed87fd4e6b93ea0ed7ff98602b",
      "statement": "scripts/infra-image-scan.mjs partitions images by COVERAGE rather than namespace: an image is scanned by whoever builds it, and everything else is enumerated here. The exclusion is membership of BUILT_IMAGE_NAMES (the six cd-deploy app images plus the from-source MinIO image), not a `jumbleknot/` prefix test, so the invariant is exactly one scanner per image — not zero and not two — and completeness is asserted against a hypothetical fixture in scripts/__tests__/infra-image-scan.test.mjs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/__tests__/infra-image-scan.test.mjs#L61-L96",
