    {
      "id": "claim_e2c7524f0eed4159b497b5f3cd81058b",
      "statement": "The authoritative sweep runs on a twice-weekly schedule (Tuesday and Friday 04:00 UTC) and is not path-gated, while the pull_request trigger deliberately has no `paths:` filter so the required `infra-image-scan / infra-image-scan` context is always posted; the Trivy steps are gated by an always-running `changes` job and a RUN_SCAN expression that forces the full sweep on every non-pull_request event.",
