    {
      "id": "claim_b28a668e48a84fc5a5a4537d67791910",
      "statement": "The allowlist expiry check runs only on scheduled runs, guarded by `always() && github.event_name == 'schedule'` so a red CVE gate cannot skip it while a dated entry can never block a pull request, and the job publishes the measured `event_name`, `gate` and `expiry_step` values as an always-`success` `infra-image-scan/expiry` commit status so that a step that ran and one that skipped are distinguishable without logs.",
