      "statement": "An allowlist entry suppresses a finding only when its `image` regex (matched unanchored against the full scanned repo:tag) and its `id` regex both match and its `expiry` is absent or not past; image/id/justification/addedBy are all required, a blank field or invalid regex is a gate error, and suppression is gate-only — allowlisted findings stay visible in the report.",
