      "statement": "Suppressions must be dischargeable by an upgrade: scripts/__tests__/infra-image-scan.test.mjs asserts for every formerly-floating repository that each allowlist key still matches the reference in the compose files today AND stops matching a synthetic later version, derived by incrementing the last numeric component of the actual pin (with a self-check that the derived ref differs from the pin) rather than read from a hand-written 'next version' map that a bump can silently invalidate.",
