      "statement": "Unmatched-allowlist-entry detection is scoped to the images a run actually scanned (`generatedForImages`, required rather than defaulted), because two jobs consult the same infra-image allowlist — the full sweep and the single-image minio-image builder, whose findings both carry the literal scanner `trivy` — and each otherwise reported the other's live entries as suppressing nothing.",
